hin|a|Having the form of, or living in, a cyst; as, the cystic entozoa. ; Containing cysts; cystose; as, cystic sarcoma. ; Pertaining to, or contained in, a cyst; esp., pertaining to, or contained in, either the urinary bladder or the gall bladder.	j:26u1,128,3~26u1,128,3
